                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A truly hidden gem. Unfortunately, such complex and futurstic Game Design is not easy to digest at first for most paesants, hench some negative reviews. Yet, this daring masterpiece reinvents everything about gaming. For example, after spending \n~40 minutes plus a couple restarts fetching a weapon, the game threw some absolutely unkillable enemies - some almighty 2-foot-long snakes. Here's the point, this game, a true pioneer of the Cruzada-like genre, lets you understand, even if's only the first encounter, that things in life don't always go the way you'd expect. \n\nA true one in a lifetime in a million in a cosmos masterpiece, that you should play for you own growth, as a gamer, but even more, as a person. \n\nPlease consider buying.",
